      "raw": "<p>One of the things I love about this game is the capacity it has to surprise me with things that I&#39;ve never noticed in cards that I&#39;ve looked at hundreds of times. &nbsp;I tend to theorize and speculate about the hidden clues far more than is healthy, so it was a joy to find something new that (as far as I know), no one else has noticed!</p><p>Take a look at the Chairman:</p><p>![](upload://oYqqlunOBT1V8CCzym1Yb9aKFwF.jpeg)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Take a closer look:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/RzlKHBf.jpg?1\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 408px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>whoa. &nbsp;too close. &nbsp;</p><p>Pull back, and take a look to the left of him. &nbsp;Who is casting that shadow?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2p1QRB7.jpg?1\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 582px;\" /></p><p>As far as I can tell, this is somebody new. &nbsp;Whoever it is has exposed (slightly sticky-uppy) hair and ears, as well as a slim physique and what look like armguards. &nbsp;Its a safe bet that I&#39;ll be looking for a match from now on!</p>",
